status GREEN -- aurora_placement 75 legs 0 failed with six mutations bitten; stash_record and instrument_refusal both GREEN on the same bytes after being red in the cold run; ladder_order GREEN after the dead line came out. Named honestly: fourteen reds of the cold run belong to peers and stand at HEAD, and I opened no fleet claim because the board read clear on both paths.
recommend keep-going -- the finding that a proxy's risk is structural rather than numeric is worth turning on the other rows of that page, and the card wants a fold before the next account lands
